  "description": "Entity Framework Core provider for Rmp.GraphOrm. DbContext extension methods that load an object graph in one SQL query with no duplicated rows; reads the EF Core model, applies global query filters, respects EF transactions. EF Core 6, 8 and 10 (.NET 6-10) - the same API as the EF6 provider, so graph queries move unchanged when a legacy app migrates from EF6. Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
